OL,3,GNEWSACouncil U-turn on housing plans   
OL,4,Aahead of inquiry                       
OL,6,FA council has said it can no longer    
OL,7,Fdefend its decision to refuse a plan   
OL,8,Ffor 255 homes at a formal hearing.     
OL,10,FThe planning inquiry into a proposal by
OL,11,FGladman Developments to build the homes
OL,12,Fin Hetton was due to take place next   
OL,13,Fmonth.                                 
OL,15,FThe project was rejected by Sunderland 
OL,16,FCity Council in October 2025, amid     
OL,17,Fconcerns it would represent "major     
OL,18,Fincursion into the open countryside"   
OL,19,Fand impact impact on "privacy, light   
OL,20,Fand outlook".                          
