OL,3,GNEWSACouncil U-turn on housing plans   
OL,4,Aahead of inquiry                       
OL,6,FThe Reform-led council has now         
OL,7,Fconfirmed it is "no longer in a        
OL,8,Fposition to defend the appeal"         
OL,9,Ffollowing changes to its housing land  
OL,10,Fsupply, which reassessed the           
OL,11,Favailability of land to meet housing   
OL,12,Fneeds over the next five years.        
